      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the next breath? how can i even do that when every breath just feels like salt in a wound? it doesn't feel like an \"ember\" elara. it feels like there's nothing left of me. i've spent my whole life trying to be what everyone needed me to be, and now that it's all gone, i realize i don't even want to be here. i feel like i'm just haunting my own life. does it even matter if i keep going?",
