    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's no one left to talk to, elara. everyone i loved is dead or gone, and the people who are left just look at me with pity or fear. it's so lonely. and even if they were here, they'd just want me to keep \"fighting\" for their sake, but i'm so done with fighting. i just want the noise to stop. i want to feel nothing. why is it so wrong to just want peace?",
